{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026QvWTZ8ohUV1788364326.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關再拘捕美妝店OPATRA LONDON一名美容顧問，涉嫌違反《商品說明條例》，至今累計三人被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最新被捕是一名22歲本地女子，屬美妝店OPATRA LONDON沙田分店的前線員工，涉嫌向消費者以不良手法營銷，及施加不當營商行為，誘使對方作出本來不會作出的購買決定。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BEAUTY-2131_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026O330x6sd5j1788363950.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BEAUTY-2131_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關指，至今收到38宗相關舉報，涉案金額由1,800元至逾20萬元，總金額達300萬元。海關強調，會調查所有關連的公司，不排除更多人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T16:03:55.335074+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}